      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Atom interferometry created a powerful route to inertial sensing and fundamental measurements using coherent matter waves.",
        "attribution": "Bordé provided foundational atom-optics concepts, and Kasevich made landmark interferometric demonstrations and sensing methods.",
        "maturity": "The methods have been repeatedly validated and now support a broad precision-measurement field.",
        "uncertainties": [
