      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The quantum cascade laser was a genuinely new semiconductor-laser principle, opening coherent mid-infrared and terahertz technologies.",
        "attribution": "Capasso's band-structure engineering was central to the concept, and Faist was central to its experimental realization.",
        "maturity": "The technology has endured for decades and enabled spectroscopy, sensing, and industrial instruments.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The contribution of other Bell Labs collaborators requires careful historical accounting."
